/* SudokuApp — English.

   The keys are the English source text, which is what SwiftUI's
   `Text("literal")` and `String(localized:)` generate. Keeping this file as
   identity mappings is therefore redundant at run time — a missing key returns
   itself — and worth having anyway: it is the list of what has to be
   translated, and `en.lproj` has to exist or a French phone would be served
   Spanish rather than English.

   Counted phrases live in Localizable.stringsdict, not here. */

